<title>USA: Central U.S. carlot beef trade 1500 CDT -USDA.</title>
<headline>Central U.S. carlot beef trade 1500 CDT -USDA.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Utility cow carcasses steady; Cutter not established. Demand and offerings moderate. --</p>
<p>    COW &amp; BULL CARCASS FOB OMAHA    4.0   Loads Reported.</p>
<p>			  Lds   Price Range    Latest Estb. Mkt.</p>
<p>UT,brk 2-4 450#/up  1.0   67.00		 67.00</p>
<p>UT,bng 1-3 400#/up  3.0   71.00		 71.00</p>
<p>Cutter 1-2 350#/up				  unq</p>
<p>Bulls YG 1 500#/up				  unq</p>
<p>BONELESS PROCESSING BEEF/BEEF TRIMMINGS     219.0  Loads</p>
<p>Reported. Fresh lean boneless beef mostly $5.00 lower late; 85% 2.50-8.50 lower; 75% started out firm, but finished mostly lower; 65% steady. Demand light to moderate for moderate to heavy offerings. Beef trimmings lower on moderate demand and fairly heavy offerings.</p>
